Translation provenance for Arktos.

The people below authored the upstream Arora translations these
catalogs grew from.  The list is kept as attribution only — they are
not reviewers for this project and patches are not routed to them.

Current flow: catalogs are completed on the `lang-work` branch by the
translation task lane (.devin/taskloop-lang.sh) and reviewed by the
Arktos maintainer before merge.  Run calculate_completion.sh in this
directory for per-catalog progress.

